    "name": "Of All Possible Rooms",
    "steam_appid": 3845460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about grief and the invisible choices we live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a home, shaped by loss. It doesn't follow the normal rules. Some rooms resemble moments that happened, while others are formed by memories that never had the chance to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement follows the emotional logic of mourning. It is uncertain, nonlinear, and difficult to face.\u00a0Avoiding what\u2019s painful can lead you in circles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spaces respond when you look at them. Others remain hidden until you're ready.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting emotional architecture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms\u00a0shift around memory, emotion, and the way you choose to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perception is progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some doors are locked by keys, most are locked by emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear journey through grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by sorrow, memory, and possibility. Each space is a reflection of something that did, or still does, matter.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What remains is not always what was.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game about grief and the invisible choices we live with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You explore a home, shaped by loss. It doesn't follow the normal rules. Some rooms resemble moments that happened, while others are formed by memories that never had the chance to exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement follows the emotional logic of mourning. It is uncertain, nonlinear, and difficult to face.\u00a0Avoiding what\u2019s painful can lead you in circles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some spaces respond when you look at them. Others remain hidden until you're ready.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting emotional architecture</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rooms\u00a0shift around memory, emotion, and the way you choose to see.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perception is progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While some doors are locked by keys, most are locked by emotion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nonlinear journey through grief</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world shaped by sorrow, memory, and possibility. Each space is a reflection of something that did, or still does, matter.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What remains is not always what was.</h2>",
    "short_description": "A narrative game about grief, memory, and perception. Explore a shifting home that reshapes itself around emotion. What you\u2019re willing to face will determine what you find, or what stays hidden.",
